Package: aether
Version: 1.0.0
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libmpv2 | libmpv1, libgtk-3-0, libsqlite3-0
Maintainer: AltairShmily <AltairShmily@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Aether Player — Emby Media Client
 A cross-platform Emby media player client built with
 Flutter + Go + C++ (libmpv). Supports video playback,
 media library browsing, and Emby server integration.
